{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"宏福苑火災一周年｜殉職消防員何偉豪未婚妻社交平台發文悼念\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/WF-HO-261126-23.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】於宏福苑大火中殉職消防員何偉豪的未婚妻，於社交平台發文悼念。</p><p>何偉豪未婚妻Kiki表示，何偉豪離世後人生發生改變，祝願遇難168位死者家屬可以笑著提起何偉豪。而何偉豪的胞兄亦於社交平台發文，他說有到廣福休憩處獻花。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T16:03:56.702187+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T15:04:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T21:37:48.969375+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T15:57:28.627425+00:00","content_hash":"26aaedf0633477784c939cd8612006e665137ae3a51506420d568b01674cea76","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}